    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf7356fc19e588e55afdc4ef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我从小就决定了。\n如果有一天自己穿上胜负服，\n一定要采用蓝色与黄色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "31c3ea35556ada8f4a3f8ddf08757fe95107fe0296caf235e4a9ff770b514579",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
