    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6ba4c3eec53ac445ab20f77",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既承载我对母亲的敬意，\n也承载着母亲支持我的心意。\n因为我想背负这两份心意去奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a41c31fbd8b9a82c7096cb4d5e585ae899278095e799f31431ce733370c74b46",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111513.json",
      "json_path": [
