    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8bb42bd63d5d84c18d4c201",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她既保留了诚恳，也坦率表达了对母亲的感情，\n给人的印象非常好。\n就保持这个状态继续彩排吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b08f96bc5b04c325dcdfb7af1d846c8e94f8a5e7adb55fb432e479bde9986210",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
